PLC in Roberts County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/roberts-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years. On the middle, May to June ran 161% of normal in 2025, and so far in 2026 April to May sits at 74% and May to June at 65%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 30434 at 36% of normal that year.</p>"}
